flowchart LR
  PO[PurchaseOrder] -->|creates| DREQ[DeliveryRequest]
  DREQ -->|moves| SHIP[Shipment]
  SHIP -->|assigned_to| DISPATCH[DispatchAssignment]
  DISPATCH -->|uses| ROUTE[TransportRoute]
  DISPATCH -->|assigns| VEH[Vehicle]
  DISPATCH -->|assigns| DRIVER[Driver]
  SHIP -->|executed_by| DEL[Delivery]
  DEL -->|has_event| DELEVT[DeliveryEvent]
  DEL -->|evidenced_by| POD[ProofOfDelivery]
  DEL -->|received_as| GRN[GoodsReceipt]
  GRN -->|updates| INV[InventoryPosition]
  GRN -->|enables| INST[Installation]
  INST -->|at| ELEM[BuildingElement / Asset]
  INST -->|verified_by| INSP[Inspection / Test]
  INSP -->|produces| ACCEPT[Acceptance / NCR / Defect]
  PO -->|billed_by| INVOICE[Invoice / ETIMS Invoice]
  INVOICE -->|settled_by| PAY[Payment]
  PAY -->|reconciled_by| SETTLE[Settlement]
  INSP -->|supported_by| EVID[Evidence]
  DEL -->|supported_by| EVID
  PAY -->|supported_by| EVID
  EVID -->|represented_by| DOC[DocumentVersion]
  DEL -->|generates| EVENT[BusinessEvent]
  PAY -->|generates| EVENT
  EVENT -->|recorded_by| AUDIT[AuditEvent]
  AI[AIJob / Recommendation] -->|reads| EVID
  AI -->|proposes| ACTION[ActionRequest]
  ACTION -->|approved_by| APPROVAL[Approval]
  ACTION -->|generates| AUDIT
